                                                                1. What factors are most important to you when renewing your professional liability policy?
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="section1" style="font-size: 1rem !important; color: #8d8a8a; margin: 0.5rem; padding-top: 15px;">
                                                                Please rate each factor on a scale from 1 (Not Important) to 5 (Extremely Important).
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="section2" style="padding-left: 25px;">
                                                                <div class="dflexcol smallGap" style="margin-top: .5rem;">
                                                                    <div aura:id="Q1New1" class="dflexcol activeQue" data-row="Survey_Coverage_Limits__c">
                                                                        <div class="item" style="color: blue;">Coverage limits:</div>
                                                                        <div class="item">
                                                                            <div class="dflex dflexjspace scale">
                                                                                <div data-que="Q1New1" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: #d15858;" data-val="1">1</div>
                                                                                <div data-que="Q1New1" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: orange;" data-val="2">2</div>
                                                                                <div data-que="Q1New1" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: #c1c125;" data-val="3">3</div>
                                                                                <div data-que="Q1New1" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: #5fce5f;" data-val="4">4</div>
                                                                                <div data-que="Q1New1" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems"  data-val="5" style="color: green;">5</div>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div aura:id="Q1New2" class="dflexcol activeQue" data-row="Survey_Customer_Service__c">
