                                                                3. How was your experience with our representative?
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="section2" style="padding-left: 25px;">
                                                                <div class="dflexcol smallGap" style="margin-top: .5rem;">
                                                                    <div class="dflex dflexjspace scale">
                                                                        <div data-que="Q3New" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: #d15858;" data-val="1">1</div>
                                                                        <div data-que="Q3New" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: orange;" data-val="2">2</div>
                                                                        <div data-que="Q3New" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: #c1c125;" data-val="3">3</div>
                                                                        <div data-que="Q3New" onclick="{!c.handleScaleInputNew}" class="dflexcolcen dflexfo scaleItems" Style="border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;color: #5fce5f;" data-val="4">4</div>
